<title>USA: McKinney, Texas, $1.75 mln won by Southwest.</title>
<headline>McKinney, Texas, $1.75 mln won by Southwest.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Southwest Securities Inc. said it won $1.75 million of McKinney, Texas, waterworks and sewer system revenue bonds, Series 1997, with a true interest cost of 5.28 percent.</p>
